{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03933","headline":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制 · 邵昇","name":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沁园佳丽夺蓬瀛，翠壁红泉绕上京。\n二圣忽从鸾殿幸，双仙正下凤楼迎。\n花含步辇空间出，树杂帷宫画里行。\n无路乘槎窥汉渚，徒知访卜就君平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵昇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}